                    <h2 id="projects-GETapi-admin-projects--id--modules">Get project module dashboard summary.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires at least one project-scoped permission for the selected project. The response exposes an <code>access</code> matrix for supported module actions, applicable project-special module keys, period context, summaries and previews. Project-specific module access is filtered by project type/module support.</p>

