                    <h2 id="projects-PUTapi-admin-projects--id--application-form">Save project application form.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>projects.application_form.update</code> for the project. Period and program must belong to the project; when a program is selected, its period is used. Previous active form for the same project/period/program context is deactivated before the new form is saved.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PUTapi-admin-projects--id--application-form">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request PUT \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/projects/1/application-form" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"period_id\": 3,
    \"program_id\": 8,
    \"fields\": [
        {
            \"id\": \"motivation\",
            \"type\": \"longtext\",
            \"label\": \"Motivasyon mektubu\",
            \"required\": true,
            \"options\": [
                \"A\",
                \"B\"
            ]
        }
    ],
    \"require_consent\": true,
    \"consent_text\": \"consequatur\",
    \"is_active\": true,
    \"auto_reject_rules\": [
        {
            \"field_id\": \"byickznkygloigmkwxphl\",
            \"operator\": \"gte\",
            \"value\": \"vazjrcnfbaqywuxhgjjmz\",
            \"reason\": \"uxjubqouzswiwxtrkimfc\"
        }
    ]
}"
</code></pre></div>


