                <h1 id="certificates">Certificates</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="certificates-GETapi-certificates-verify--verificationCode-">Verify a certificate by code.</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Public endpoint used by web/mobile certificate verification screens. No bearer token is required. The response confirms validity and returns public certificate metadata plus recipient name/surname; it does not require panel permissions.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-certificates-verify--verificationCode-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/certificates/verify/ABC123" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
