                    <h2 id="certificates-DELETEapi-admin-certificates--id-">Delete a certificate.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/certificates/{id}</code> and <code>/panel/certificates/{id}</code>. Requires <code>certificates.delete</code> and delete access to the certificate project. The related period must be writable; completed periods require archive update permission. The certificate file is removed from storage and the operation is audit logged as <code>certificate.deleted</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-DELETEapi-admin-certificates--id-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request DELETE \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/certificates/1" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


