                <h1 id="newsletter">Newsletter</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="newsletter-POSTapi-newsletter-subscribe">Subscribe to the newsletter.</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Public endpoint. No bearer token is required and the route is throttled. Existing subscribers are reactivated by clearing <code>unsubscribed_at</code>. A confirmation email is sent with a signed unsubscribe link.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-newsletter-subscribe">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/newsletter/subscribe" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"email\": \"hakan@example.com\",
    \"name\": \"Hakan Kekec\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/newsletter/subscribe"
);

