                    <h2 id="newsletter-GETapi-admin-newsletter-subscribers">List newsletter subscribers.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/newsletter/subscribers</code> and <code>/panel/newsletter/subscribers</code>. Requires <code>newsletter.view</code> with global/tum sistem scope because subscriber emails are system-wide personal data. Returns active subscribers only and paginates by 50.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-admin-newsletter-subscribers">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/newsletter/subscribers?search=hakan%40example.com" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


