                <h1 id="contact">Contact</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="contact-POSTapi-contact">Create a public contact support ticket.</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Public contact endpoint. No bearer token is required; requests are throttled at route level. If <code>project_id</code> or a category maps to a known project/unit, the ticket may be auto-assigned and notification emails are sent through the configured notification service.</p>
<p>Send as <code>multipart/form-data</code> when uploading an attachment. Official document categories may require an attachment.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-contact">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
