                    <h2 id="applications-POSTapi-applications--id--waitlist-response">Respond to a waitlist invitation.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Allows the current applicant to accept or reject an active waitlist invitation. Accepting may create or activate the participant record when quota rules allow it.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-applications--id--waitlist-response">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/applications/1/waitlist-response" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"decision\": \"accept\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
