                    <h2 id="applications-POSTapi-applications">Create an authenticated project application.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires KVKK consent. Dynamic application form fields are accepted in <code>form_data</code>; file fields must be uploaded as <code>multipart/form-data</code> under <code>form_files[field_id]</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-applications">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/applications" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"project_id\": 1,
    \"program_id\": 5,
    \"form_data\": {
        \"motivation\": \"Projeye katilmak istiyorum\"
    },
    \"form_files\": [],
    \"consent_accepted\": true
}"
</code></pre></div>


