                                <h2 id="programs-attendance-GETapi-programs">List participant programs.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>participant.programs.view</code>. Lists programs for the current user active/graduated participations with attendance, credit, and feedback state.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-programs">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/programs" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


