                    <h2 id="programs-attendance-GETapi-panel-programs--id--attendances-export">Export program attendance details.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>programs.attendance.export</code> for the program project. Returns a binary CSV/XLSX/PDF/DOCX file depending on <code>format</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-programs--id--attendances-export">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
