                    <h2 id="forum-POSTapi-forum-posts">Create a forum post.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>participant.forum.view</code>. The current user must participate in the selected project and, when <code>period_id</code> is given, that period. Completed period archives cannot receive new posts.</p>

