                    <h2 id="requests-GETapi-panel-requests-export">Export workflow requests.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Participant/mobile routes use the route-level <code>participant.support.manage</code> gate; panel/admin routes require <code>requests.export</code>. Non-global users are filtered to requester, target user, manageable project ids, or allowed target units. The shared export responder accepts <code>csv</code>, <code>xlsx</code>, or <code>pdf</code> when enabled.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-requests-export">
