                    <h2 id="requests-PUTapi-panel-requests--id--status">Update workflow request status.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Participant/mobile routes use the route-level <code>participant.support.manage</code> gate; panel/admin routes require <code>requests.update_status</code>. The target request must be manageable through global scope, target user ownership, target unit scope, or project scope. Status changes are audit logged.</p>

