                    <h2 id="requests-GETapi-panel-requests--id--response-file">Download a workflow request response file.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The requester can download their response file. Panel users can download when they can manage the request through <code>requests.view</code>, <code>requests.upload_response</code>, or <code>requests.update_status</code>. Returns a storage direct URL when configured; otherwise streams the binary file. Downloads are audit logged.</p>

