                    <h2 id="support-GETapi-panel-support-tickets-export">Export panel support tickets.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint. Requires <code>support.export</code>; users with global scope export all matching tickets, while scoped users export only manageable project tickets plus tickets assigned to or created by them. The shared export responder accepts <code>csv</code>, <code>xlsx</code>, or <code>pdf</code> when enabled.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-support-tickets-export">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/support/tickets/export?status=closed&amp;category=official_doc&amp;project_id=1&amp;period_id=1&amp;search=evrak&amp;format=xlsx" \
