                    <h2 id="announcements-inbox-GETapi-admin-announcements-communication-logs">List announcement communication logs.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>announcements.view</code>. Global users can see all email/SMS logs; project-scoped users see logs they sent or logs in accessible projects. Supports type, status, project, sender, search and date filters.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-admin-announcements-communication-logs">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
