                    <h2 id="announcements-inbox-GETapi-admin-announcements-export">Export panel announcements.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>announcements.export</code>. Applies the same manageable announcement scope and filters as the list endpoint, then exports through the shared admin export responder.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-admin-announcements-export">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/announcements/export?category=general&amp;project_id=1&amp;period_id=3&amp;format=csv" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"category\": \"vmqeopfuudtdsufvyvddq\",
    \"project_id\": 17,
    \"period_id\": 17
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/announcements/export"
);

const params = {
    "category": "general",
