                    <h2 id="announcements-inbox-PUTapi-admin-inbox-messages-state">Update unified inbox message state.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Updates read, starred and pinned state for a visible announcement, alumni opportunity or forum post. Visibility is rechecked server-side using participant project/period rules or panel <code>announcements.view</code> scope before creating/updating the state row.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PUTapi-admin-inbox-messages-state">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request PUT \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/inbox/messages/state" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"source_type\": \"App\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Announcement\",
    \"source_id\": 1,
    \"is_read\": true,
    \"is_starred\": false,
    \"is_pinned\": true
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
