                    <h2 id="announcements-inbox-GETapi-panel-announcements--id-">Get panel announcement details.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>announcements.view</code> and access to the announcement. Global users can view all; project-scoped users can view manageable project announcements or their own global announcements.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-announcements--id-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
