                    <h2 id="admin-dashboard-GETapi-admin-dashboard-activity-logs-export">Export panel activity logs.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>logs.export</code>. Global scope exports all matching logs; scoped users are limited to their own activity plus permission matrix logs. Export is capped to the latest 1000 filtered rows and returns a binary CSV/XLSX/PDF/DOCX file depending on <code>format</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-admin-dashboard-activity-logs-export">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


