                    <h2 id="admin-applications-GETapi-panel-applications--id--form-files--field-">Download an application form file.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>applications.view</code> and project access for the application project. If direct public downloads are configured, the endpoint returns a JSON <code>download_url</code>; otherwise it streams the stored file.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-applications--id--form-files--field-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/applications/12/form-files/cv_file" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


