                    <h2 id="admin-applications-POSTapi-panel-applications--id--waitlist-invite">Send a waitlist invitation.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>applications.waitlist.manage</code> and project access for the application project. Only waitlisted applications can be invited; quota and active invitation rules are enforced by the waitlist service.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-applications--id--waitlist-invite">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/applications/12/waitlist-invite" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"expires_at\": \"2026-07-03 23:59:00\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/applications/12/waitlist-invite"
