                    <h2 id="project-special-modules-POSTapi-admin-projects--id--special-modules-eurodesk-projects--eurodeskProjectId--partnerships">Create a Eurodesk partnership.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

