                    <h2 id="project-special-modules-POSTapi-panel-projects--id--special-modules-kademe-modules">Create a KADEME+ project module.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>projects.rewards.manage</code> for the project and a project type that supports KADEME+ module workflow. Optional period must belong to the project and completed periods require archive update permission.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-projects--id--special-modules-kademe-modules">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/projects/1/special-modules/kademe-modules" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"title\": \"Liderlik Atolyesi\",
    \"period_id\": 3,
    \"description\": \"Dolores dolorum amet iste laborum eius est dolor.\",
    \"sort_order\": 1,
    \"is_active\": true,
    \"application_open\": true,
    \"requires_consent\": true,
    \"consent_checkbox_label\": \"consequatur\",
    \"warning_text\": \"consequatur\",
    \"requires_coordinator_approval\": false,
    \"outcomes\": [
        \"Takim calismasi\"
    ],
    \"instructors\": [
        []
    ],
    \"faq_items\": [
        []
    ]
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/projects/1/special-modules/kademe-modules"
);

