                    <h2 id="periods-GETapi-panel-periods-export">Export panel periods.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>periods.export</code>. Global scope exports all periods; scoped users export only periods in permitted projects. Returns a binary CSV/XLSX/PDF/DOCX file depending on <code>format</code>.</p>

