                    <h2 id="financials-POSTapi-admin-financials">Create a financial transaction.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin and coordinator endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/financials</code>, <code>/panel/financials</code>, and <code>/coordinator/financials</code>. Requires <code>financial.create</code>. If <code>project_id</code> is supplied, the actor must have create scope for that project; creating a projectless financial transaction requires global <code>financial.create</code> scope. If <code>period_id</code> is supplied, it must belong to the selected project and the period must be writable.</p>
<p>Send as <code>multipart/form-data</code> when uploading an invoice. Created transactions start as <code>pending</code> and are audit logged as <code>financial.created</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-admin-financials">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/financials" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: multipart/form-data" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --form "project_id=1"\
    --form "period_id=3"\
    --form "type=expense"\
    --form "category=travel"\
    --form "category_note=amniihfqcoynlazghdtqt"\
    --form "spending_unit=Operasyon"\
    --form "payee_name=ABC Turizm"\
    --form "amount=1250.5"\
    --form "invoice_no=INV-2026-001"\
    --form "payment_date=2026-02-01"\
    --form "payment_method=bank_transfer"\
    --form "accounting_code=770.01"\
    --form "invoice=@C:\Users\kresc\AppData\Local\Temp\php6A2F.tmp" </code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/financials"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "multipart/form-data",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

const body = new FormData();
body.append('project_id', '1');
body.append('period_id', '3');
body.append('type', 'expense');
body.append('category', 'travel');
body.append('category_note', 'amniihfqcoynlazghdtqt');
body.append('spending_unit', 'Operasyon');
body.append('payee_name', 'ABC Turizm');
body.append('amount', '1250.5');
body.append('invoice_no', 'INV-2026-001');
body.append('payment_date', '2026-02-01');
body.append('payment_method', 'bank_transfer');
body.append('accounting_code', '770.01');
body.append('invoice', document.querySelector('input[name="invoice"]').files[0]);

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body,
