                    <h2 id="financials-GETapi-admin-financials--id-">Show a financial transaction.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/financials/{id}</code> and <code>/panel/financials/{id}</code>. Requires <code>financial.view</code> access to the transaction project; projectless records require the permission itself. Includes project, period, submitter, and approver summary data.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-admin-financials--id-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/financials/1" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


