                    <h2 id="financials-DELETEapi-panel-financials--id-">Delete a pending financial transaction.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/financials/{id}</code> and <code>/panel/financials/{id}</code>. Requires <code>financial.delete</code> and access to the transaction project. The related period must be writable and only <code>pending</code> transactions can be deleted. Attached invoice files are removed from storage and the deletion is audit logged as <code>financial.deleted</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-DELETEapi-panel-financials--id-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request DELETE \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/financials/1" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
