                    <h2 id="users-POSTapi-panel-kvkk-forget-requests--id--resolve">Resolve a KVKK forget request.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>users.update</code> with global <code>all</code> scope. Approving anonymizes personal account fields, deletes profile/staff profile records, revokes tokens and stores an anonymization summary. Rejecting stores reviewer metadata without anonymizing. The operation is audited as <code>users.kvkk_forget.resolved</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-kvkk-forget-requests--id--resolve">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/kvkk/forget-requests/3/resolve" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"decision\": \"approve\",
    \"reviewer_note\": \"Talep uygun bulundu.\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/kvkk/forget-requests/3/resolve"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "decision": "approve",
    "reviewer_note": "Talep uygun bulundu."
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

