<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires <code>users.update</code> for status-only changes and <code>users.assign_role</code> when <code>role</code> is present. Role assignment additionally requires global <code>all</code> scope. Target access is checked with <code>PermissionResolver::canAccessUser</code>; status aliases are normalized before saving.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PUTapi-panel-users--id-">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request PUT \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/users/55" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"role\": \"alumni\",
    \"status\": \"passive\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/users/55"
);

