                    <h2 id="permissions-matrix-GETapi-admin-permissions-matrix-users">List users for permission overrides.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>permissions.user_override.view</code> with global <code>all</code> scope. Returns non-banned users with Spatie roles and staff unit/title metadata for the override panel.</p>

