                    <h2 id="permissions-matrix-DELETEapi-panel-permissions-matrix-roles--id-">Delete a custom role.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>permissions.matrix.update</code> with global <code>all</code> scope. System roles cannot be deleted and roles assigned to users must be unassigned first. Clears the permission cache and logs <code>role.custom.deleted</code>.</p>

