                    <h2 id="staff-GETapi-admin-staff-active">List active and on-leave staff.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>staff.view</code>. Active staff are approximated by Sanctum tokens used in the last 8 hours; on-leave staff are approved leave requests covering today. Non-global viewers are limited to their unit.</p>

