                    <h2 id="staff-GETapi-panel-members">List members visible to the current staff user.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>staff.view</code>. The current user must have a staff unit. Rows are filtered through <code>PermissionResolver::applyUserScope</code>, so global users can see all matching staff while own-unit users only see their unit.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-panel-members">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/members?search=uzman" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


