                    <h2 id="trainers-POSTapi-panel-trainers">Create a trainer.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>trainers.create</code> with a usable scope. Creates a project-independent trainer profile, stores creator/updater metadata and prepares audit attributes for the activity log.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-trainers">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/trainers" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"first_name\": \"Ayse\",
    \"last_name\": \"Yilmaz\",
    \"email\": \"ayse@example.com\",
    \"phone\": \"05550000000\",
    \"title\": \"Egitmen\",
    \"organization\": \"Kademe\",
    \"expertise\": \"Liderlik, iletisim\",
    \"status\": \"candidate\",
    \"last_worked_at\": \"2026-06-01\",
    \"bio\": \"consequatur\",
    \"notes\": \"consequatur\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


