                    <h2 id="trainers-GETapi-panel-trainers--id-">Get trainer details.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>trainers.view</code> with a usable scope. Includes creator, updater and Kademe comment updater metadata when available.</p>

