                    <h2 id="trainers-POSTapi-panel-trainers--id--email">Send an email to a trainer.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Requires permission: <code>trainers.email</code> with a usable scope. The trainer must have an email address. Sends through the existing notification/email service and stores trainer email audit attributes.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-trainers--id--email">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/trainers/1/email" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"subject\": \"Program Daveti\",
    \"body\": \"Merhaba, sizi yeni programa davet etmek isteriz.\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


