                    <h2 id="site-settings-PUTapi-panel-site-settings">Update panel site settings.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/site-settings</code> and <code>/panel/site-settings</code>. Requires global scope for either <code>settings.update</code> or <code>content.site_settings.update</code>. Accepts grouped settings for public site configuration, stores scalar values as strings and arrays as JSON, normalizes the response with defaults, and clears the short-lived public homepage cache.</p>
<p>Supported top-level groups are <code>general</code>, <code>contact</code>, <code>social_media</code>, <code>navigation</code>, <code>homepage</code>, <code>about</code>, <code>blog_page</code>, and <code>faq_page</code>. Unknown nested keys inside accepted groups are stored as provided, so mobile/web clients should send the full intended group shape when replacing complex arrays such as navigation links or homepage blocks.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PUTapi-panel-site-settings">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request PUT \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/site-settings" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"settings\": {
        \"general\": {
            \"site_name\": \"KADEME\",
            \"site_tagline\": \"Gelecegin Liderlik Okulu\"
        },
        \"contact\": {
            \"contact_email\": \"info@kademe.org\"
        },
        \"social_media\": {
            \"instagram_url\": \"https:\\/\\/instagram.com\\/kademe\"
        },
        \"navigation\": {
            \"header_links\": [
                {
                    \"label\": \"Ana Sayfa\",
                    \"href\": \"\\/\"
                }
            ]
        },
        \"homepage\": {
            \"stats_mode\": \"auto\",
            \"block_order\": [
                \"hero\",
                \"projects\"
            ]
        },
        \"about\": [],
        \"blog_page\": [],
        \"faq_page\": []
    }
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/site-settings"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "settings": {
        "general": {
            "site_name": "KADEME",
            "site_tagline": "Gelecegin Liderlik Okulu"
        },
        "contact": {
            "contact_email": "info@kademe.org"
        },
        "social_media": {
            "instagram_url": "https:\/\/instagram.com\/kademe"
        },
        "navigation": {
            "header_links": [
                {
                    "label": "Ana Sayfa",
                    "href": "\/"
                }
            ]
        },
        "homepage": {
            "stats_mode": "auto",
            "block_order": [
                "hero",
                "projects"
            ]
        },
        "about": [],
        "blog_page": [],
        "faq_page": []
    }
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "PUT",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

