                <h1 id="chatbot">Chatbot</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="chatbot-POSTapi-admin-chatbot-query">Query the panel data assistant.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/chatbot/query</code> and <code>/panel/chatbot/query</code>. The caller must have global <code>all</code> scope for <code>chatbot.view</code> or <code>chatbot.manage</code>; having only the chatbot permission does not bypass data permissions. The service is rule-based, never executes raw SQL from user input, and each intent checks its own action+scope and project visibility before reading data.</p>
<p>Supported examples include participant/application/program/financial/project comparison summaries, trainers, logs, users, staff, support tickets, workflow requests, announcements, periods, volunteer opportunities, digital bohca, assignments, certificates, project special modules, and system guidance about action+scope, project-specific modules, or CV/PDF behavior.</p>
<p>Responses may include <code>table.columns</code>, <code>table.rows</code>, <code>stats</code>, and an <code>export_token</code>. Export tokens are cached for the requesting user for 15 minutes and can be downloaded from the export endpoint as CSV, XLSX/Excel, PDF, DOCX/Word.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-admin-chatbot-query">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/chatbot/query" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"message\": \"Diplomasi360 katilimci listesi son 30 gun limit 50\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/chatbot/query"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "message": "Diplomasi360 katilimci listesi son 30 gun limit 50"
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

</span>

