                    <h2 id="calendar-POSTapi-panel-calendar-meetings">Create a calendar meeting.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Creates a manual calendar meeting separate from programs. Exposed under <code>/panel/calendar/meetings</code> and <code>/calendar/meetings</code>. Requires <code>calendar.meetings.create</code>. Project-linked meetings require project access for that action; projectless general meetings require global scope. If <code>period_id</code> is supplied, it must belong to the selected project and the period must be writable.</p>
<p>Assigned users are filtered to active coordinator/staff users that are valid for the meeting project, or any active coordinator/staff user for a general meeting.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-panel-calendar-meetings">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/calendar/meetings" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"project_id\": 3,
    \"period_id\": 12,
    \"title\": \"Haftalik koordinasyon\",
    \"description\": \"Program hazirlik toplantisi\",
    \"location\": \"KADEME Merkez\",
    \"start_at\": \"2026-07-10T10:00:00+03:00\",
    \"end_at\": \"2026-07-10T11:00:00+03:00\",
    \"assigned_user_ids\": [
        7,
        8
    ]
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/panel/calendar/meetings"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "project_id": 3,
    "period_id": 12,
    "title": "Haftalik koordinasyon",
    "description": "Program hazirlik toplantisi",
    "location": "KADEME Merkez",
    "start_at": "2026-07-10T10:00:00+03:00",
    "end_at": "2026-07-10T11:00:00+03:00",
    "assigned_user_ids": [
        7,
        8
    ]
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

</span>

