                    <h2 id="calendar-GETapi-calendar-google-status">Get Google Calendar connection status.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Exposed under <code>/panel/calendar/google/status</code> and <code>/calendar/google/status</code>. Requires <code>calendar.view</code>. Returns whether Google credentials are configured, whether a refresh token is stored, the configured calendar ID, and last sync/error timestamps.</p>

