                    <h2 id="personality-tests-POSTapi-admin-personality-test-templates">Create a personality test template.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Panel/admin endpoint exposed under <code>/admin/personality-test-templates</code> and <code>/panel/personality-test-templates</code>. Requires global scope for at least one of <code>content.personality.manage</code>, <code>content.site_settings.update</code>, or <code>settings.update</code>. Questions and result ranges are synced transactionally; setting <code>is_active=true</code> deactivates all other templates.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-admin-personality-test-templates">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/admin/personality-test-templates" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"name\": \"Varsayilan test\",
    \"description\": \"Guncel kisilik analizi\",
    \"is_active\": true,
    \"questions\": [
        {
            \"question_key\": \"leadership_1\",
            \"category\": \"leadership\",
            \"text\": \"Ekip calismasinda sorumluluk alirim.\",
            \"sort_order\": 1
        }
    ],
    \"result_ranges\": [
        {
            \"category\": \"leadership\",
            \"summary\": \"Liderlik yonu guclu.\"
        }
    ]
}"
</code></pre></div>


